     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Reading instructions",
     "texto": [
      "**forudsætning** = prerequisite; **dokumentation** = documentation; **frist** = deadline. In a condition, **hvis** introduces the case and the main clause states the result."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Passive and agent",
     "texto": [
      "**Ansøgningen behandles inden fire uger** = The application is processed within four weeks. The passive focuses the information on the process; the agent can be left out if it adds nothing."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
